Prefer TanStack Table if it is already installed.

Tables may support:

```text
Search
Filtering
Sorting
Pagination
Column Visibility
Row Selection
Bulk Actions
Export
```

Use reusable column definitions.

Example:

```javascript
const columns = useMemo(
  () => [
    // columns
  ],
  [],
);
```

### Common inventory actions

Depending on permissions:

```text
View
Edit
Adjust Stock
Transfer
Archive
Delete
```

### Don't

* Don't duplicate table implementations.
* Don't put complex transformations inside cell renderers.
* Don't show actions to users without the required permission.

