# Search, Filters & Pagination

### Do

Support server-side filtering for large datasets when the backend provides it.

Common filters:

```text
Search
Category
Supplier
Warehouse
Stock Status
Date Range
Product
```

Pagination may use:

```text
page
pageSize
limit
offset
```

Use only the parameter names supported by the backend API.

### Don't

* Don't invent query parameters.
* Don't perform expensive client-side filtering on large datasets when server-side filtering exists.
* Don't unexpectedly reset unrelated filters.

---

# Bulk Actions

For tables that support row selection, provide bulk actions where appropriate.

Examples:

```text
Bulk Delete
Bulk Archive
Bulk Stock Update
Bulk Status Update
Export Selected
```

### Do

* Show selected row count.
* Show loading state during bulk operations.
* Disable duplicate submissions.
* Refresh affected lists after mutations.
* Display success/error feedback.

### Don't

Don't allow bulk actions to run without permission checks.

