# File & Naming Conventions

| Kind              | Location                             | Naming                      |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------- |
| Page              | `src/features/**/pages/`             | `InventoryPage.jsx`         |
| Component         | `src/components/`                    | `InventoryTable.jsx`        |
| Feature Component | `src/features/**/components/`        | `StockAdjustmentDialog.jsx` |
| Service           | `src/services/`                      | `inventory.service.js`      |
| Store             | `src/store/`                         | `useInventoryStore.js`      |
| Hook              | `src/hooks/`                         | `useInventory.js`           |
| Schema            | `src/features/**/` or `src/schemas/` | `product.schema.js`         |
| Mapper            | `src/lib/`                           | `inventory-mappers.js`      |
| Utility           | `src/lib/`                           | `format-currency.js`        |
| Constants         | `src/constants/`                     | `inventory-status.js`       |

Use **PascalCase** for React components.

Use **camelCase** for functions and variables.

Use **UPPER_SNAKE_CASE** for constants where appropriate.

Use **kebab-case** for route paths.

