# Definition of Done

Before considering a feature complete:

* [ ] Existing project structure was reviewed.
* [ ] Existing reusable components were checked.
* [ ] Existing hooks were checked.
* [ ] Existing services were checked.
* [ ] Existing stores were checked.
* [ ] API endpoint matches the backend contract.
* [ ] API request payload is mapped correctly.
* [ ] API response is mapped correctly.
* [ ] Form validation is implemented where required.
* [ ] Loading state is handled.
* [ ] Error state is handled.
* [ ] Empty state is handled.
* [ ] Permission checks are implemented where applicable.
* [ ] Mutation buttons have loading/disabled states.
* [ ] Duplicate submissions are prevented.
* [ ] No secrets were added.
* [ ] No hardcoded API URLs were added.
* [ ] No unrelated files were changed.
* [ ] `npm run lint` passes when available.
* [ ] `npm run build` passes.
* [ ] Final diff is minimal and focused.
